224996bd917551af3e7. All nine scoped blobs remain identical to the previously reviewed ecadc1125 candidate, and all four page scripts remain byte-identical to main. No workflow, payload, branch guard, permission or clinical behavior changes.\n\nThe original owner-approved appearance expectations and delegated REG6 target expectation remain unchanged. The four local controls have a 44px phone/tablet minimum: quick identification type, Consultation/OTC buttons and Edit member/staff reference. Existing assertion adaptations retain their behavioral and layout checks. Emergency Contact, Family and TRI2 remain separate.\n\nValidation at the unchanged original source: 2,205 frontend tests, types/build, changed-page lint/format and independent source review. Historical actual-browser evidence at ecadc1125 covers 24 control measurements and 12 captures at 390/768/1440, light/dark, with focus and unobstructed targets. This is bounded control geometry, not whole-page demo parity.\n\nAfter upstream integration, 106 focused frontend tests, types and production build passed at d8c77e296. The final merge adds only the unrelated Trial fixture; all nine blobs remain unchanged and final independent exact-head parity is clear. No new browser execution or full backend local test is claimed. Fresh CI at the final head is required before merge. Synthetic data only; no deployment.\n","created_at":"2026-11-26T05:20:18Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:17Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9799d1cd56d902e8722d5cfae6c4bb7d7676d6a5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1132/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1132/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayame